* Exact Transistor-Level Subcircuit for LM741 Operational Amplifier
* Parametric Transistor Sizing for AI Agent Optimization
* Pinout: 3:IN+  2:IN-  7:VCC  4:VEE  6:OUT
.subckt LM741_TRANSISTOR 3 2 7 4 6

.param C_comp = 8p
.param R_bias = 39k
.param R_widlar = 5k

* Transistor Models (Silicon Bipolar Process)
.model NP NPN(BF=125 Cje=.5p Cjc=.5p Rb=500)
.model PN LPNP(BF=25 Cje=.3p Cjc=1.5p Rb=250)

* --- Input Stage (Q1 - Q8) ---
Q1 N001 3 N008 0 NP
Q2 N001 2 N009 0 NP
Q5 N011 N010 N009 0 PN
Q6 N013 N010 N008 0 PN
Q7 N013 N016 N018 0 NP
Q8 N011 N016 N019 0 NP
Q3 7 N013 N016 0 NP
Q4 N001 N001 7 0 PN

R1 N018 4 1K
R2 N016 4 50K
R3 N019 4 1K

* --- Biasing Network (Q9 - Q13) ---
Q9 N010 N001 7 0 PN
Q10 N002 N002 7 0 PN
Q11 N003 N002 7 0 PN
Q12 N014 N014 4 0 NP
Q13 N010 N014 N020 0 NP
R4 N020 4 {R_widlar}
R13 N002 N014 {R_bias}

* --- Gain Stage & Compensation (Q14 - Q17, C1, R5 - R8) ---
Q14 N003 N004 N007 0 NP
Q15 N007 N015 N017 0 NP
Q16 N007 N011 N015 0 NP
R5 N015 4 50K
R6 N017 4 50
Q17 N011 N017 4 0 NP
C1 N003 N011 {C_comp}
R7 N007 N004 7.5K
R8 N003 N004 4.5K

* --- Output Stage (Q18 - Q20, R9, R10) ---
Q18 7 N003 N005 0 NP
Q19 4 N007 N012 0 PN
R9 N005 6 25
R10 6 N012 50
Q20 N003 N005 6 0 NP

.ends LM741_TRANSISTOR
